//Heart and Soul
//This is the third shell I made for this ghost. The original two were pallet swaps of each other, named "Red and Blue Version" and "Gold and Silver Version". Quite cute.
//This shell is named after the remakes, of course.
//The original was drawn in 2021 and never finished. After five years of deliberating on the colors and designs, I finally remade it starting September 2026.

//Inspired by how Zarla makes her shells, this one is set up with "bases" with no arms or facial features, that then get those appended onto them like stickers. This makes more smoother transitions between various expressions, more natural poses, and, less work, in my opinion.
//I've included comments and guides on certain parts in case anyone is curious. My code is free to use.

version,1 //Changes from old definition to new definition. I don't think it's important I do that but I would rather use the newest of everything in case I run across something later telling me I can only do this funny animation trick if I convert everything to new. boo

//Both characters
//\i[20] is the talking animation
//\i[55] is the "stop talking" setting. Put it in dialogue for things like menus.
//All other intervals are random because omg do I not want to number everything.

//Sens
//1000s - Base Poses
//1100s - Talking/Blinking Frames
//1200s - Arms

